WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,880
Shaoyang, go and help move

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,360
All supplies are in my car

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,720
Lu Wen, what about you?

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,660
Captain Lu has made the greatest contribution, of course we have to move

5
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,500
Everyone, go and move all the supplies into Captain Lu's car.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:24,220
Go to Ping An Base and spend the night first

7
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,300
Will move again tomorrow

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,460
It's too dangerous to move around at night, okay?

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,820
I've already made arrangements at the base and am waiting for you to come.

10
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,820
OK, let's go
